  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Volume bound in purple fabric with green print on page 1 of cover. Spine has cut out section and binding is red string, hand sewn and wrapped around top and bottom sections of spine. Within, black prints illustrated story printed in black on white paper. One page has affixed folded print. Another piece, made up of two pieces of paper with printed imagery is between two pages, but not affixed to the volume. Green slip of paper bound in with the words "Todxs tenemos una isla". Story ends with print in red on otherwise blank white page. Leaf before colophon has print of house with window cut out collaged to form pocket into which green folded sheet is inserted. Sheet contains lists of favorites of both the author and the artist.</subfield>
  </datafield>
